{"prompt_hash": "05554ace8bc3173f8f8511fe4b2baa8f55c53d07ee670dd4112609740b961209", "text": "[\n  {\n    \"query_text\": \"Analyze the historical performance of the S&P 500 versus Gold from January 1, 2000, to December 31, 2020. Provide a summary of the total percentage growth for both assets, identify which had higher volatility, and list the three most significant market crashes that occurred during this specific timeframe.\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"medium\",\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"finance\",\n      \"historical analysis\",\n      \"market research\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"query_text\": \"Compare the nutritional profiles of 100g of raw kale, 100g of raw spinach, and 100g of Swiss chard. Specifically, create a table showing calories, Vitamin A, Vitamin K, Vitamin C, and Calcium content for each, then provide a brief research summary on which leafy green is most beneficial for bone density based on these values.\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"medium\",\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"health\",\n      \"nutrition\",\n      \"comparative analysis\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"query_text\": \"Based on the following quarterly sales data for 'TechGadget Corp' in 2023, calculate the quarter-over-quarter growth rate and identify which product line had the most consistent growth. Data: Q1: Smartphones $50M, Laptops $30M, Tablets $10M; Q2: Smartphones $55M, Laptops $32M, Tablets $9M; Q3: Smartphones $62M, Laptops $35M, Tablets $11M; Q4: Smartphones $70M, Laptops $38M, Tablets $15M.\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"hard\",\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"data analysis\",\n      \"business\",\n      \"finance\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"query_text\": \"Research the primary differences between the Montessori and Waldorf educational philosophies for early childhood (ages 3-6). Compare their approaches to structured play, the use of technology in the classroom, and the role of the teacher in guiding student activities.\",\n    \"difficulty\": \"medium\",\n    \"tags\": [\n      \"education\",\n      \"